# --- agent working files ---
# 1,171 files, including a full Claude Code worktree under
# .claude/worktrees/, were being served publicly: `outputDirectory` is "." in
# vercel.json, so the repo root IS the deploy root and this directory shipped
# with it. Live and indexable at /.claude/settings.local.json and
# /.claude/worktrees/<id>/**, which put 962 duplicate HTML pages (a near-copy
# of the whole site under a second path) and the api/ server source on the
# public domain. It is untracked by git, so nothing in the normal review path
# would ever have shown it.
/.claude

# --- internal tooling: pSEO generators + ops scripts ---
/_*.py
/_*.py.DONE
/scripts
# Translation tooling. All 10 files here are .mjs generator scripts and were
# being served 200 (repo root is the deploy root). Nothing references /i18n/ —
# the localized PAGES live in /es, /fr, /pt, which are untouched by this.
/i18n

# Stray cross-brand page. calculator.html is ChurnLens's internal "Funnel Math
# Calculator" (Brunson benchmark conversion rates, MRR) — it was live at
# carshake.online/calculator with <title>Funnel Math Calculator — ChurnLens</title>
# and `index, follow`, on a domain about valet damage. Orphaned (0 internal links,
# absent from the sitemap) and it was the sole source of the dead /get-the-checklist
# link, whose CTA offered ChurnLens's "23-Point Checklist". Not deleted — just not
# served here.
/calculator.html

